+/*
+ * Bulk attachments (colour space, transfer function, ...): 0x70 bytes, then at
+ * +0x70 their size, +0x78 a mask of the fields that changed, +0x80 the surface
+ * id. The fields, by their bit, are these byte ranges of the 0x70.
